      "seed": 624000339,
      "version": 188,
      "versionNonce": 142364147,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766606366504,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在这一套框架下，\n对一个框架的掌控力会变的更好，\n才能越来越自由地去创造，",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在这一套框架下，\n对一个框架的掌控力会变的更好，\n才能越来越自由地去创造，",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
